# Rule 1: Internal Port Scan
alert tcp any any -> any any (msg:"MINI-SOC Scan"; flags:S; threshold: type both, track by_src, count 20, seconds 5; sid:1000001; rev:1;)

# Rule 2: ProFTPD mod_copy exploit
